---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Argendon SandiDry Pro 35C Review — Testing in Progress | Buy Better Finds" description="We are hands-on testing the Argendon SandiDry Pro 35C crawl space dehumidifier. Check back for original photos, real-world results and our independent review." noindex={true}>
  <article class="article sandidry-preview">
    <a class="back-link" href="/reviews/">← All Hands-On Reviews</a>
    <div class="review-status">● HANDS-ON TESTING IN PROGRESS</div>
    <h1>Argendon SandiDry Pro 35C Review: Testing in Progress</h1>
    <p class="lead">We have received the SandiDry Pro 35C and are currently evaluating it. Check back soon for our complete, firsthand review.</p>
    <div class="preview-grid">
      <div class="product-photo"><img src="https://www.argendon.com/cdn/shop/files/70-pint-commercial-dehumidifier-argendon-sandidry-pro-35c.webp?v=1767503709&width=1946" alt="Argendon SandiDry Pro 35C dehumidifier, manufacturer product photo" width="1000" height="1000" loading="eager" /><small>Image courtesy of Argendon. Original testing photos will be added to the completed review.</small></div>
      <div class="preview-copy">
        <h2>Our review is underway</h2>
        <p>We are taking time to evaluate setup, everyday operation, moisture removal, drainage options, noise and usability. We will share what we actually observe, including strengths and limitations, when testing is complete.</p>
        <div class="notice"><strong>Full review coming soon</strong><p>Our current target is approximately 2–3 weeks, subject to completing meaningful testing. No verdict or rating has been assigned yet.</p></div>
        <a class="product-link" href="https://www.argendon.com/products/crawl-space-dehumidifier-sandidry-pro-35c" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View product details at Argendon →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2>Manufacturer-listed specifications</h2>
    <p>These are Argendon's published specifications, not independent measurements or confirmed results from our testing.</p>
    <div class="specs"><div><strong>Moisture removal</strong><span>35 pints/day (AHAM); 70 pints/day (saturation)</span></div><div><strong>Advertised coverage</strong><span>Up to 1,000 sq. ft.</span></div><div><strong>Drainage</strong><span>Gravity drain and built-in condensate pump</span></div><div><strong>Listed weight</strong><span>40.5 lb</span></div></div>
    <h2>Our editorial disclosure</h2>
    <p>Argendon provided this dehumidifier to Buy Better Finds at no cost for review. The complimentary sample does not guarantee a positive review. Our assessment will reflect our own testing and observations. Any affiliate links included in the completed review will be clearly disclosed.</p>
    <p><a href="/reviews/">Explore our hands-on reviews →</a></p>
  </article>
  <style>
    .sandidry-preview{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:42px 22px 70px}
    .back-link{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:24px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .review-status{display:inline-block;background:#fff0d7;color:#8b4300;border:1px solid #f3cc89;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 13px;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.07em}
    .sandidry-preview h1{max-width:850px;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.1;margin:18px 0}
    .sandidry-preview .lead{font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.65;max-width:850px;color:#435066}
    .preview-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:36px;align-items:center;margin:32px 0 45px}
    .product-photo{background:#f6f8fb;border:1px solid #e3e8ef;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;text-align:center}
    .product-photo img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px}
    .product-photo small{display:block;margin-top:12px;color:#5b6574;line-height:1.5}
    .preview-copy h2{margin-top:0}
    .preview-copy p{line-height:1.7}
    .notice{background:#eef5ff;border-left:4px solid #003087;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:8px;margin:22px 0}
    .notice p{margin:6px 0 0}
    .product-link{display:inline-block;background:#c8102e;color:white!important;font-weight:800;padding:13px 18px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}
    .specs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:20px 0 35px}
    .specs div{border:1px solid #e1e6ec;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
    .specs span{color:#475569}
    @media(max-width:720px){.preview-grid,.specs{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sandidry-preview{padding:28px 16px 55px}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>